# AI-Powered Healthcare Fraud Detection

This project uses Dify workflows and AI models to identify suspicious healthcare claims before payment.

## Features
- Fraud Detection
- Risk Scoring
- Claims Analysis
- Human Review Pipeline

## Tech Stack
- Dify
- OpenAI
- Python
- Streamlit

## Import Workflow
1. Download the `.yml` file
2. Open Dify
3. Click Import DSL
4. Upload the file
